  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Kenya and East Africa: closing gaps in devolved health service delivery for select counties</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Closing Gaps in Devolved Health Service Delivery for Select Counties program will train financial experts to support county governments, work hand-in-hand with County Assemblies to improve oversight of healthcare spending and strengthen health-related policies and regulations. The result will be stronger, more accountable county health systems that are more transparent and better funded.</narrative>
  </description>
